<title>USA: St Paul hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Top  $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   57.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   57.00-57.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   56.00-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 1.00 higher. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   46.50-47.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   48.00</p>
</text>
